          "level": "h2",
          "text": "Causes of bad breath"
        }
      ],
      "text": "Causes of bad breath\nCauses of bad breath include:\neating or drinking strong-smelling or spicy foods and drinks\nproblems with your teeth or gums, such as\ngum disease\n, holes in your teeth or an infection\nfasting or crash dieting\nsome medical conditions, like\ndry mouth\n,\ntonsillitis\nand\nacid reflux\nsmoking",
      "lists": [
        {
          "type": "unordered",
          "items": [
            "eating or drinking strong-smelling or spicy foods and drinks",
            "problems with your teeth or gums, such as\ngum disease\n, holes in your teeth or an infection",
            "fasting or crash dieting",
            "some medical conditions, like\ndry mouth\n,\ntonsillitis\nand\nacid reflux",
            "smoking"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "links": [
