      "html": "<section>\n<h2 id=\"causes\">Causes of bad breath</h2>\n<p data-block-key=\"x0dvl\">Causes of bad breath include:</p><ul><li data-block-key=\"84i96\">eating or drinking strong-smelling or spicy foods and drinks</li><li data-block-key=\"1m1ct\">problems with your teeth or gums, such as <a href=\"/conditions/gum-disease/\">gum disease</a>, holes in your teeth or an infection</li><li data-block-key=\"u0rvf\">fasting or crash dieting</li><li data-block-key=\"xslhu\">some medical conditions, like <a href=\"/symptoms/dry-mouth/\">dry mouth</a>, <a href=\"/conditions/tonsillitis/\">tonsillitis</a> and <a href=\"/conditions/heartburn-and-acid-reflux/\">acid reflux</a></li><li data-block-key=\"9nwjj\">smoking</li></ul>\n</section>"
